          },
          {
            "children" : [
              {
                "text" : "Aircraft control takes priority over radio calls."
              },
              {
                "text" : "Do not request the barrier."
              },
              {
                "text" : "Avoid setting the parking brake after heavy braking."
              }
            ],
            "text" : "Notes:"
          },
          {
            "text" : "N\/W\/C focus: The major warning is the same one from earlier events: keep aircraft control first and respect the brake-overheat risk after aggressive stopping."
